WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.640
So I tried mixing it with
ramune the other day.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:06.440
How did it turn out?

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.100
It's been getting warmer
recently, hasn't it?

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:15.740
Yeah...

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.820
It will be spring soon!

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:19.700
Yeah...

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.120
Tougou-san, you know, I...

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.500
Yeah...

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.000
I'm getting married.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.170
Yeah...

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.500
What?

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:32.240
It's kind of sudden, but Yuuki
Yuuna is getting married.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:39.140
Wh-Wh-What are you saying Yuuna-chan?!
You're still in middle school!

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.520
And who's the groom?!

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.620
The Shinju-sama.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:31.420
U-Um...

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.820
Please raise your head.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.470
Wh-What...

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.600
What brings you here today?

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:49.560
There is something I must tell you
immediately, Yuuna-sama.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:53.560
I have already asked your
parents for their consent.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.960
F-For what?

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:00.440
The Shinju-sama, who has been protecting us for the last three hundred years,

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:03.200
is approaching the end of its lifespan.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:04.140
Eh?

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.450
If the Shinju-sama wilts,

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:07.460
the barrier protecting us from the
flames outside will collapse...
If the Shinju-sama wilts,

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:10.870
the barrier protecting us from the
flames outside will collapse...

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:14.210
and the world we live in will
be engulfed in flames...

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:15.580
and be erased.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.760
Erased...

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.590
While it is regrettable-

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:20.600
Wait! Wait! This is all too sudden!
While it is regrettable-

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.040
Wait! Wait! This is all too sudden!

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:26.310
We can't let it be erased!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:28.430
It is as you say.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.440
We cannot afford to lose mankind.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:38.230
We've found a way for everyone
to live and escape extinction.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:42.660
Um... wouldn't it be better if the
entire Hero Club heard this?

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.910
I wanted you to be the first one to hear it.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.800
There is one way to save everyone:

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:55.420
To have a chosen human
marry the Shinju-sama.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.080
Eh? Marry?

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:00.880
By "marry" you mean <i>that</i> kind of "marry", right?

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:01.920
Indeed.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.010
Since ancient times, the act of marrying a god...

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.140
Divine Matrimony
has been known as "Shinkon".

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:11.890
It is a ceremony through which a god and a sacred maiden form a union to ensure the world's peace.

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.400
That is what Shinkon is.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:24.910
Um...

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:29.120
Will this save everyone?

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.060
Yes.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.180
It can save them...

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:37.340
By performing the Shinkon, a new power will be bestowed upon humanity.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:43.050
They will become the gods' kin, living
with the Shinju-sama for eternity.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.500
Did you understand that?

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:48.390
I still don't really get it,

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.180
but I don't want everybody to die.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:54.640
We share the same sentiments
as you, Yuuna-sama.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:05:00.460
If the Shinkon succeeds, the chosen
girl will enter the divine realm,

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:03.150
and lose the ability to interact
with the physical realm.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.360
Um...

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:08.220
In other words, the girl who participates
in the Shinkon will die.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:15.840
Through an oracle, the Shinju-sama chose you
as the bride for the Shinkon, Yuuna-sama.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.750
Wh-Why me again?

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.100
Because you are close to the
gods in both body and soul:

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:25.160
a Misukata.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:33.640
I believe that the reason the Heavenly Gods chose you as a sacrifice is similar.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:38.270
I have to marry a god...

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:45.320
We at the Taisha have been looking for different methods to ensure humanity's survival,

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:50.060
but this is the only option we have left.

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:54.290
Um... I'm sorry.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.910
I can't give you an
answer right away.

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:59.080
I'm still trying to take all of this in.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:02.460
You are already shouldering the
wrath of the Heavenly Gods.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.210
It must be very difficult for you -

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:07.760
being unable to tell anyone anything
because of the curse.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.980
Even though I couldn't tell anyone,

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:14.350
there were probably better ways
I could've let them know.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:18.420
I... really hurt my friend.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.560
You hold love for everyone in your heart.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:25.540
I believe that you are a great Hero.

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:27.280
That's not true at all.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:33.200
You're the only one who can save both that friend and the entire human race, Yuuna-sama.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:41.620
If I undergo the Shinkon, that thing about people becoming the gods' kin and living forever with the Shinju-sama...

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:41.630
It's just as it says.
If I undergo the Shinkon, that thing about people becoming the gods' kin and living forever with the Shinju-sama...

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.960
It's just as it says.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:49.970
The Shinju-sama will oversee
us in a peaceful world.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.340
All hope is lost if humanity dies,

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:56.660
but once we are close to the gods
and live with the Shinju-sama,

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.430
we will have hope.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.810
Will everyone still be human?

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:06.820
Under the care of the gods, we will still be able to exist.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:10.820
Those who have great faith will
return to the Shinju-sama.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:16.790
Everyone... will be with the Shinju-sama...

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:18.370
Please...

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.160
