00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.260
Please make the benevolent choice.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.360
First a curse, then a marriage.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:46.440
It's shocking, isn't it, Gyuuki?

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:50.240
Mom and Dad were crying,

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:54.100
but they said it was up to me. However,

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:55.990
my body...

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:57.880
My life...

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.580
They're already...

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:07.710
