dying from the curse?</i>

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.320
This isn't good. I shouldn't be
thinking only about myself.

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.540
I'm a Hero.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.900
I need to do the heroic thing.

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:25.780
I won't allow this world to
be engulfed in flames!

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.240
I don't want that to happen! Ever!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.240
Hero Club five tenets.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.600
You're likely to succeed if you try.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:36.870
That's right!

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:40.370
I don't have the time to
hesitate or be scared.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.500
I have to do this!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.260
Because I'm a Hero!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.340
