to take upon yourself?

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:45.080
Yuuyu.
What exactly are you going
to take upon yourself?

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.190
Yuuyu.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:46.200
I think this is wrong.
Yuuyu.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.150
I think this is wrong.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.420
Everyone...

