00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.520
Then we can use those!

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.110
but we found they were
impossible to realize.

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.110
Why did you just decide that?!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.490
We are out of time.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:40.990
Yuuna-sama will undergo
the Shinkon ritual soon.

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.540
Bullshit!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.700
We'll stop it!

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:49.440
Many of the esteemed Heroes of the past lost their lives in the line of duty.

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:54.920
Two years ago, Minowa Gin-sama
died in order to protect mankind.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:18:00.500
Gin-sama fought desperately
to ensure mankind's safety,

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:00.510
fulfilled her duty admirably, and joined
the ranks of the fallen legends.
Gin-sama fought desperately
to ensure mankind's safety,

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:04.120
fulfilled her duty admirably, and joined
the ranks of the fallen legends.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:08.860
Although her struggle takes
on a different form,

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:12.150
Yuuna-sama will also offer herself
for the greater good.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.650
You must realize that this is
what it means to be a Hero.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:20.910
And you just want us to accept this?

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.790
Heroes and Mikos of the past...

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:28.290
They were all around our age, right?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:33.300
That means we've always sacrificed
children to survive?!

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.050
Is that the messed up
world we live in?!

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:42.050
If there is no other option, it is something that must be done if we want to stay alive.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:46.080
This is the way of humanity in this day and age.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.350
Something that must... be done?

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.300
Indeed.

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:51.310
You didn't like green peppers, right?
Indeed.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.480
You didn't like green peppers, right?

00:18:55.160 --> 00:19:01.340
You were very strict, but I really liked the charming side you showed from time to time.

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:07.000
But you're no longer the Aki-sensei I knew back then.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.250
You mourned for Gin together with us...

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:15.590
Since you know the pain of loss, how can you still bear to sacrifice another person?!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.620
Your classmates,

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:19.630
their friends,
Your classmates,

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.590
their friends,

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:22.970
their families,

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:26.310
are all looking forward to the coming spring,

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.060
as they eat udon in their homes,

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.100
sleep in their warm futons,

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.610
and spend yet another peaceful day as they always have.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:42.070
Through small sacrifices, many people are able to live happily.

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.370
If you think so...

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.700
Then why don't you sacrifice yourselves instead?!

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:51.080
We would, if it were possible.

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:55.590
However, the Shinju-sama will not accept us.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:20:00.720
Maybe it accepts you because you can still feel angry about this...

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:06.660
This is-

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:23.490
Are they already here?

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.940
H-Hey, what's the meaning of this?!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.530
It's your turn.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:33.750
It appears that the Heavenly Gods are enraged by how close a human has come to the powers of the gods,

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.290
and have passed their judgment:

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:40.550
that it is outrageous for a
human to marry a god.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:43.800
The Vertex are coming?

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:45.300
No.

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:58.060
What... is happening?

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:25.430
An enemy in the real world?!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.550
Is that... an enemy?

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.320
What is that?

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:33.200
That thing is...

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:48.960
The Shinkon will be completed when Yuuna-sama goes to where the Shinju-sama is,

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:52.950
and vows to take the wishes of the people upon herself.

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:56.460
When the Shinkon has been conducted,

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:56.500
mankind will live forever with the gods.

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.460
I'm not afraid. I'm not afraid!

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:01.340
If we are no longer human, we will not be attacked anymore.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:06.360
Thus, everyone will be able to live in peace beside the Shinju-sama.

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:11.470
This will be your final duty.

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:18.230
Repel the enemy's attacks until the Shinkon is complete.
